# v0.9.0-rc.1

## Major
- Release-candidate hardening pass.
- Unified merchant/bank/inn/sell data-building into a single shared module so the GM Settlement Manager and the player location window always behave identically (previously drifted copies).
## Minor
- Fixed: player deposits/withdrawals sent over the socket are now processed (payload was previously mis-routed and silently dropped).
- Security: bank deposit/withdrawal socket handlers now verify the requesting player owns the target actor.
- Player shop view now hides sold-out items and auto-selects a default bank actor, matching the GM window.
- Inn random-menu draws now respect the min/max draw range in both windows.
- Performance: world-time updates re-render open windows on a debounce instead of every tick; item lookups cached per render.
- Restock/menu save failures are now logged instead of silently swallowed.

